{
  "description": "Edits on a localized master that avoid copying localized strings (the port does not assign them yet): copy as override and as new record, set, add and remove elements including an entry of an array by index, a reference to a new record. DLCRobot.esm loads before DLCworkshop01.esm, as the official order of the GUI has it. The oracle runs without the reference information (build_refs false): building it initialises every record, which adds the required members the port adds only to the records it touches.",
